<div class="iq-hero">
<h1>How to Use Our Website</h1>
<p>Everything you need to order from InkQuest — pick a topic below.</p>
<label class="tour-start" for="tour0">Take a Tour &#9654;</label>
</div>

<div class="iq-cards">
